{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-url-router#card-zh","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-url-router","commit":"d79431a4ada9e60fbd0c1e611eb110e2dd554d2c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-url-router 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的地址栏路由插件，通过浏览器端模块把当前会话、主面板及部分面板内页面映射为 URL fragment，并从链接恢复对应界面。它同步会话和面板导航，支持插件、任务看板、设置等页面链接，为会话行和插件列表行添加可右键复制或在新标签打开的链接；桌面版还可在标题栏区域提供地址栏，并保存最近访问链接及显示偏好。适合需要分享或收藏 DSH 界面链接的用户。设置保存在本机 localStorage；无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1914","lib/client.js:3272","lib/client.js:4183","lib/client.js:4688","lib/client.js:5757"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-url-router#card-en","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-url-router","commit":"d79431a4ada9e60fbd0c1e611eb110e2dd554d2c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-url-router gives DSH conversations, panels, and supported inner pages shareable URL fragments and restores views from links. It adds browser links to conversation and plugin rows and an address bar to desktop title bars. Recent links stay local; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1914","lib/client.js:3272","lib/client.js:4183","lib/client.js:4688","lib/client.js:5757"]}
