{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-url-router#feature-1","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-url-router","commit":"d79431a4ada9e60fbd0c1e611eb110e2dd554d2c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-url-router 的功能「界面深链接」：把当前会话、主面板和支持的内页编码进 URL fragment；打开对应链接时解析路径并导航到目标界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1914","lib/client.js:1972"]}
